sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Maya as Maya
    participant Arch as architect (subagent)
    participant Exp as /3c-explain (skill)
    participant Issue as GitHub Issue

    Maya->>Arch: dispatch with issue context
    Note over Arch: reads CLAUDE.md + .claude/rules/
    Arch-->>Maya: affected components / approach<br/>risks / open questions<br/>complexity / testing strategy

    Note over Maya: reads carefully<br/>spots a pattern<br/>that doesn't fit
    Maya->>Exp: /3c-explain layered-mvc.rationale
    Exp-->>Maya: Why / Do / Docs (from rationale.yaml)

    Maya->>Arch: re-dispatch with the rationale<br/>"reconsider — our boundary lives elsewhere"
    Note over Arch: revises analysis<br/>(architect re-writes,<br/>NOT Maya)
    Arch-->>Maya: revised approach + revised testing strategy

    Maya->>Issue: architect appends the analysis<br/>(via /3c-implement later)
    Note over Issue: enriched, ready for code
